  "local_avatar_path": "",
  "content_html": "<div id=\"main\">\n\t\t<section id=\"primary\">\n\t\t\t<div id=\"profile\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cover\" style=\"background-image: url();\"><div class=\"scores\"><span class=\"score-label\">累積人氣<span class=\"score\">1440</span></span><span class=\"score-label\">累積讚數<span class=\"score\">39</span></span><span class=\"score-label\">台客獎章<span class=\"score\">5</span></span></div></div><div class=\"author-info\"><img src=\"http://www.gravatar.com/avatar/7261f9a20e19f837377d0b864fcd8ef7?d=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/plugins/avatar/mystery-man.jpg&amp;s=150\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-19-avatar\" width='150' height='150' /><h2 class=\"name-title\">Vicamo Yang</h2><h3 class=\"description\"></h3><div class=\"bio\"></div></div>\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<hr>\n\t\t\t<h2>Vicamo Yang 發表的文章</h2>\n\t\t\t<div id=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-div divider\">\t\t\t\t\n<article id=\"post-1231\" class=\"post-1231 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-b2g tag-emulator tag-firefox-os\">\n\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/1231/hacking-firefox-os-emulator-for-ril\" title=\"Permalink to Hacking Firefox OS Emulator for RIL\" rel=\"bookmark\">Hacking Firefox OS Emulator for RIL</a></h2>\n    <p class=\"entry-posted\">\n      <time datetime=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" title=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" class=\"published\">\n        <a title=\"See all posts from May, 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2013/01\" class=\"posted-month\">1月</a>\n        <span class=\"posted-date\">02</span>\n        <a title=\"See all posts from 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2013\" class=\"posted-year\">2013</a>\n      </time>\n    </p>\n      \t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n      <div class=\"author-meta\" data-author-id=\"19\">\n        <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/vyangmozilla-com\">\n          <img src=\"http://www.gravatar.com/avatar/7261f9a20e19f837377d0b864fcd8ef7?d=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/plugins/avatar/mystery-man.jpg&amp;s=24\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-19-avatar\" width='24' height='24' /><!--\n       --><div class=\"author-info\">Vicamo Yang</div><!--\n       --><div class=\"author-title\"></div>\n        </a>\n        </div>\n      </div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\n\t<div class=\"thumb-img\"><img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2013/01/Firefox-OS-150x150.png\"/></div>\t<div class=\"entry-content half\">\n\t\t《Mo語》：「不學 Emulator 無以 test；不寫 test 無以 land！」\r\n之前我們介紹過 Firefox OS Emulator，也聊過如何使用 Marionette 來為 Firefox OS 寫測試項；今天我們來研究一下如何為模擬器新增功能來協助開發 RIL (Radio Interface Layer) 相關的測試項。Firefox OS 基於 Gonk，利用 Gonk 所.....<a class=\"more\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/1231/hacking-firefox-os-emulator-for-ril\">深入了解</a>  \n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\t\n  <footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n            <div class=\"entry-category-box\">\n      文章分類：\n      <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/b2g\" rel=\"category tag\">Firefox OS(B2G)</a>    </div>\n        <div class=\"entry-social-box\">\n      社群分享：\n     <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/1231/hacking-firefox-os-emulator-for-ril\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-width=\"40\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-font=\"arial\"></div>     <!-- Place this tag where you want the +1 button to render. -->\n     \n     <div class=\"google-share\"><div class=\"g-plusone\" name=\"gplus\" data-size=\"medium\" data-annotation=\"bubble\" data-width=\"40\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/1231/hacking-firefox-os-emulator-for-ril\"></div></div>     \n    <div class=\"pinterest-share\"><a href=\"http://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/1231/hacking-firefox-os-emulator-for-ril&media=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2013/01/Firefox-OS-150x150.png\" data-pin-do=\"buttonPin\" data-pin-config=\"none\" data-pin-color=\"red\" class=\"pin-it-button\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"//assets.pinterest.com/images/PinExt.png\" title=\"Pin It\" /></a></div>      <div class=\"plurk-share\">\n        <a href=\"javascript: void(window.open('http://www.plurk.com/?qualifier=shares&status=' .concat(encodeURIComponent('http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/1231/hacking-firefox-os-emulator-for-ril')) .concat(' ') .concat('&#40;') .concat(encodeURIComponent(document.title)) .concat('&#41;')));\">\n          <img src=\"https://s.plurk.com/2980c7bcb4eb012159e7701a61cb2e75.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"plurk share\">\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"comment-share\">\n        <a class=\"comment-button\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/1231/hacking-firefox-os-emulator-for-ril#respond\">留言<div class=\"count-bubble\">1</div></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</article><!-- #post-1231 -->\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-div divider\">\t\t\t\t\n<article id=\"post-183\" class=\"post-183 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-b2g\">\n\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/183/%e5%b7%a5%e7%a8%8b%e5%b8%ab%e7%9a%84%e3%80%8c%e4%bb%8a%e5%a4%a9%e3%80%8d%e6%98%af%e5%88%b0%e3%80%8c%e6%98%8e%e5%a4%a9%e6%97%a9%e4%b8%8a%e3%80%8d\" title=\"Permalink to 工程師的「今天」是到「明天早上」\" rel=\"bookmark\">工程師的「今天」是到「明天早上」</a></h2>\n    <p class=\"entry-posted\">\n      <time datetime=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" title=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" class=\"published\">\n        <a title=\"See all posts from May, 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2012/06\" class=\"posted-month\">6月</a>\n        <span class=\"posted-date\">25</span>\n        <a title=\"See all posts from 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2012\" class=\"posted-year\">2012</a>\n      </time>\n    </p>\n      \t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n      <div class=\"author-meta\" data-author-id=\"19\">\n        <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/vyangmozilla-com\">\n          <img src=\"http://www.gravatar.com/avatar/7261f9a20e19f837377d0b864fcd8ef7?d=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/plugins/avatar/mystery-man.jpg&amp;s=24\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-19-avatar\" width='24' height='24' /><!--\n       --><div class=\"author-info\">Vicamo Yang</div><!--\n       --><div class=\"author-title\"></div>\n        </a>\n        </div>\n      </div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content \">\n\t\t事實證明不需要開 PS3 也可能拖稿。\r\n\r\n早早設了鬧鐘，想趁早來個「單騎強登枕頭峰，孤帆勇渡棉被海」，落筆如有神…，直到 X window 吐了一行：\r\n[crayon-554562cb5e152480372687/]\r\n顯然昨晚的 Ubuntu upgrade 又中了什麼樣的黑魔法。\r\n\r\n總是這樣，要比其他人早一步知道怎麼解問題，就得要早一步遇到它。最近 Ubuntu 12.04 Prec.....<a class=\"more\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/183/%e5%b7%a5%e7%a8%8b%e5%b8%ab%e7%9a%84%e3%80%8c%e4%bb%8a%e5%a4%a9%e3%80%8d%e6%98%af%e5%88%b0%e3%80%8c%e6%98%8e%e5%a4%a9%e6%97%a9%e4%b8%8a%e3%80%8d\">深入了解</a>  \n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\t\n  <footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n            <div class=\"entry-category-box\">\n      文章分類：\n      <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/b2g\" rel=\"category tag\">Firefox OS(B2G)</a>    </div>\n        <div class=\"entry-social-box\">\n      社群分享：\n     <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/183/%e5%b7%a5%e7%a8%8b%e5%b8%ab%e7%9a%84%e3%80%8c%e4%bb%8a%e5%a4%a9%e3%80%8d%e6%98%af%e5%88%b0%e3%80%8c%e6%98%8e%e5%a4%a9%e6%97%a9%e4%b8%8a%e3%80%8d\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-width=\"40\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-font=\"arial\"></div>     <!-- Place this tag where you want the +1 button to render. -->\n     \n     <div class=\"google-share\"><div class=\"g-plusone\" name=\"gplus\" data-size=\"medium\" data-annotation=\"bubble\" data-width=\"40\" data-hr